Senseii Search
Senseii Search is a proposal for the creation of a HumInt powered platform that focuses on
finding and cultivating a network of peers on the MetaNet who provide truthful information and
good quality education.
Our ultimate goal is the accurate assignment and management of Intellectual Property rights to
enable the equitable distribution of capital amongst billions of stakeholders, using the Bitcoin
Network.
*Note for the reader: In this paper, the term ‘Bitcoin’ always refers to the original implementation
of the Bitcoin protocol now known as ‘BitcoinSV’ (BSV), and not BTC.
