Senseii LTD
Introduction:
Although Bitcoin (BSV) is 13 years old, good information about it is hard to
find as competitors have an incentive to suppress it, and deep pockets with
which to game Google’s algorithms.
As a result, most people think BTC is Bitcoin not BSV, and students,
entrepreneurs and business people are not familiar with the opportunities
that Bitcoin truly offers.
Consequently, there’s a lack of strong teachers in the Bitcoin space, and
pitching Bitcoin to students is inefficient. They may be in the middle of a
three-year education and not ready to start a business on a technology
which is often misrepresented in Google searches, and profoundly
misunderstood by the media.
Additionally, money raised by Bitcoin entrepreneurs is usually not raised in
Bitcoin or a national CBDC, nor are shares in Bitcoin companies issued on
Bitcoin by default yet.
Because of this, entrepreneurs must be trusted not to waste funds and
equity cannot be atomically swapped or tracked in real-time. Many of the
benefits of building on Bitcoin are lost as Bitcoin entrepreneurs get bogged
down in the bureaucracy of legacy systems.
What we need is an architecture that supports Bitcoin entrepreneurs by
allowing them to raise money directly in Bitcoin from sources like the Tulip
Trust, in such a way that they can also benefit from tax advantages like the
SEIS program offered by HMRC.
To solve this problem we propose an app that allows student entrepreneurs
to capture, format, distribute and capitalise on their Intellectual Property in
a methodological framework where they can prove the order of events
concerning the creation or exchange of digital goods and services,
including the issuing of securities, to the satisfaction of HMRC and Bitcoin
investors.
Every Dojo needs a Senseii
To achieve our goals, Senseii LTD proposes an intuitive contracting platform called
‘Senseii’ that automatically tokenizes and indexes the Intellectual Property of the user,
in return for a 1% stake in their IP token, whatever that token contains. IP Tokens may
contain photos, emails, text messages, forum comments, or any digital asset that a user
produces on their device.
Senseii’s architecture means that Bitcoin entrepreneurs with the most valuable
conglomerations of IP will rise to the top of Senseii’s search index as they gather more
intellectual capital from their peers in the form of likes, comments, and other tokenised
IP that links value back to them.
We call this new paradigm ‘Economically Weighted Search’ (EWS) and when combined
with Peer-Reviewed Validation (a.k.a. “Social Proof”), it has the power to replace
Google’s ‘PageRank’ altogether and break Google down into hundreds of competing
search engines.
Here’s how it works: Users can tokenize anything they like on their device, from
pictures, to videos, emails, text-messages etc at the push of a button, and Senseii
hashes it, creates a token with the hash, assigns the user rights to 99% of the sale of
their IP token and adds hashes of their identity into the IP Token. Senseii then copies
the users IP token for fast indexing and lookup on the Senseii database and assigns 1%
ownership of the revenue from the sale of the IP token to Senseii LTD.
The Senseii platform incrementally teaches entrepreneurs how to tweak their IP to raise
capital, pay out salaries, dividends and royalties, deliver annuities, issue coupons and
pay other forms of interest on the completion of unilateral contracts, offered by Senseii
LTD. (An example of a unilateral contract might be: “Populate the topic ‘Mathematics’ for
10p, and contracts are paid out as verified peers review the content). *See “Pay to Correct”.
Senseii’s methodology will allow investors to capitalise on a vast new swathe of Bitcoin
entrepreneurs in a legally compliant, auditable and private way, where balances and
revenues can be tracked and shared in real-time, shares in companies traded instantly,
agreements signed and board-meetings held; and where companies can be bought and
sold as single NFTs with all their associated IP, revenues, staff, partnerships, records
etc, intact.
Tools: Shuriken and Kitana
Senseii has developed two main tools to help entrepreneurs get the most out of Bitcoin:
Shuriken and Kitana.
Shuriken automatically captures and tokenizes all users’ IP for them, regardless of what apps
they’re using.
Kitana continuously references, indexes and updates the state of users’ IP for instant lookup,
retrieval and settlement of consideration.
User’s IP can be referenced arbitrarily and recursively, allowing an unbounded arrangement of
contractual obligations to be placed on it at any time.
Senseii provides near instant updates on the global state of contractual agreements on a user’s
IP, and can order and attribute payments faster and at a lower cost than any other decentralised
system.
Using Senseii, a one-word answer in an SMS text-message can instantly deliver
fractions of a penny to its author, plus thousands of invested stakeholders
simultaneously.
Senseii also allows users to choose the level of bandwidth they are willing to share to become a
node in a distributed CDN. The more IP a user creates and shares whilst using Senseii on their
devices, the wealthier they become.